<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About - Blog Board</title>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/styles.css" />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-[#F6DDC3]">
    <%- include("partials/header") %>

    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8" style="color: #eb4e00">
        About Blog Board
      </h1>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Blog Board is a simple blogging platform where users can create, edit,
          view, and delete posts.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          This project was built using Node.js, Express.js, EJS, and Tailwind
          CSS as part of my web development learning journey.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          The goal of Blog Board is to provide a clean and simple space for
          sharing thoughts, stories, and ideas.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>
  </body>
</html>
